TITLE 1D transport 10 cells, 10 shifts, cation exchange

SOLUTION 0  Infilling
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

SOLUTION 1-10 Initial
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings step cell m_HCl
10 PUNCH SIM_NO, CELL_NO, MOL("HCl")

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -time_step 1
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions constant constant
    -punch_cells 1-10
    -punch_frequency 1
    -diffusion_coefficient 0
    -dispersivities 0
    -lengths 1

END
